**Tiers (documented, NOT enforced in this build):** Free — 1 full week of planning/month. Pro ~$24.99/mo — 15 pantry photo uploads/mo (N/A this build, no photo feature yet). Elite ~$35/mo — unlimited photos + receipt scanning (N/A this build). Every authenticated user gets full feature access in this build; no subscription gate is enforced. A `subscriptions` table and a `PLANS` constant are still created now so Stripe wiring later is additive, not a rebuild.

**Account types:** One account type for this build, but schema uses the **workspace pattern** (not raw `user_id` scoping) — a workspace is a household of one owner for now, so Phase 3's 2-person household accounts become additive rather than a migration rewrite.

